{"ticker":"UHS","updated":"2026-10-30T23:19:39Z","profile":{"longName":"Universal Health Services, Inc.","shortName":"Universal Health Services, Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Care Facilities","country":"United States","website":"https://uhs.com","fullTimeEmployees":102000,"marketCap":10375774208,"trailingPE":7.3691926,"forwardPE":7.531461,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.5653573,"pegRatio":1.19,"targetMeanPrice":192.41176,"targetHighPrice":250.0,"targetLowPrice":156.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":17,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.053,"earningsGrowth":-0.109,"grossMargins":0.44505,"operatingMargins":0.09601,"profitMargins":0.07965,"totalRevenue":18352594944,"beta":1.029,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":246.33,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":140.08,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.45},"summary":"Universal Health Services, Inc., through its subsidiaries, owns and operates acute care hospitals, and outpatient and behavioral health care facilities in the United States. It operates through Acute Care Hospital Services and Behavioral Health Care Services segments. The company's hospitals offer general and specialty surgery, internal medicine, obstetrics, emergency room care, radiology, oncology, diagnostic and coronary care, pediatric, pharmacy, and/or behavioral health services. It also provides commercial health insurance services; capital resources; and various management services, including central purchasing, information services, finance and control systems, facilities planning, physician recruitment, administrative personnel management, marketing, and public relations services. Universal Health Services, Inc. was founded in 1978 and is headquartered in King of Prussia, Pennsylvania.","summary_zh":"Universal Health Services, Inc. 透過其子公司在美國擁有並經營急診醫院以及門診和行為醫療機構。它透過急診醫院服務和行為健康護理服務部門運作。該公司的醫院提供一般外科和專科外科、內科、產科、急診室護理、放射科、腫瘤科、診斷和冠狀動脈護理、兒科、藥房和/或行為健康服務。也提供商業健康保險服務；資本資源；以及各種管理服務，包括中央採購、資訊服務、財務和控制系統、設施規劃、醫生招聘、行政人事管理、行銷和公共關係服務。 Universal H