/或營運 375 個住院設施和 168 個門診及其他設施。我們改變了 2025 年第三季門診行為醫療機構計數的方法，基本上所有與前期相比的成長都與慣例的改變有關。"},{"en":"Net revenues from our acute care hospitals, outpatient facilities and commercial health insurer accounted for approximately 57% of our consolidated net revenues during each of 2025 and 2024. Net revenues from our behavioral health care facilities and commercial health insurer accounted for approximately 43% of our consolidated net revenues during each of 2025 and 2024.","zh":""}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The health care industry is highly competitive. In recent years, competition among healthcare providers for patients has intensified in the United States due to, among other things, regulatory and technological changes, increasing use of managed care payment systems, cost containment pressures and a shift toward outpatient treatment. In all of the geographical areas in which we operate, there are other facilities that provide services comparable to those offered by our facilities. In addition, some of our competitors include hospitals that are owned by tax-supported governmental agencies or by nonprofit corporations and may be supported by endowments and charitable contributions and exempt from property, sale and income taxes. Such exemptions and support are not available to us.","zh":"医疗保健行业竞争激烈。近年來，由於監管和技術變革、管理式醫療支付系統的使用增加、成本控制壓力以及向門診治療的轉變等原因，美國醫療保健提供者之間為患者提供的競爭加劇。在我们运营的所有地理区域中，还有其他设施提供与我们设施提供的服务相当的服务。此外，我們的一些競爭對手包括由稅收支持的政府機構或非營利公司擁有的醫院，這些醫院可能得到捐贈和慈善捐款的支持，並免徵財產稅、銷售稅和所得稅。我们无法获得此类豁免和支持。"},{"en":"In some markets, certain of our competitors may have greater financial resources, be better equipped and offer a broader range of services than us. Certain hospitals that are located in the areas served by our facilities are specialty or large hospitals that provide medical, surgical and behavioral health services, facilities and equipment that are not available at our hospitals. The increase in","zh":"在某些市場，我們的某些競爭對手可能比我們擁有更多的財務資源、更好的裝備並提供更廣泛的服務。位於我們設施服務區域的某些醫院是專科醫院或大型醫院，提供我們醫院不提供的醫療、外科和行為健康服務以及設施和設備。增加的"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Acute Care Hospital Services","val":9925907000,"zh":"急診醫院服務"},{"name":"Behavioral Health Services","val":7425500000,"zh":"行為健康服務"},{"name":"State Medicaid Programs","val":56000000,"zh":"全國醫療補助計劃"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":13422000,"zh":"所有其他部門"}],"total":17364829000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Managed Care","val":4902096000,"zh":"管理式護理"},{"name":"Medicaid","val":2686967000,"zh":"醫療補助"},{"name":"Managed Medicaid","val":2482601000,"zh":"管理醫療補助"},{"name":"Managed Medicare","val":2080278000,"zh":"管理式醫療保險"},{"name":"Medicare","val":1856404000,"zh":"醫療保險"},{"name":"Other Patient Revenue & Adjustments Net","val":1240278000,"zh":"Other Patient Revenue & Adjustments Net"},{"name":"Other Non Patient Revenue","val":1114849000,"zh":"其他非患者收入"},{"name":"UK Revenue","val":1001356000,"zh":"英國收入"}],"total":17364829000}},"peers":["HCA","TFX","COO","THC","HSIC"]}}